      "divergence": {
        "note": "2026-09-09: boilerplate app/view frame. Matches the Figma \"App Shell\" COMPONENT (page sherpa-app-shell, node 1016:35752) — GRID: Primary Navigation (left rail) | App Header (top) | content SLOT. PRE-COMPOSED: the nav/header <slot>s carry default <sherpa-nav>/<sherpa-app-header> fallback instances (replaceable by slotting your own). KNOWN DEF GAP: the thin-def model cannot represent slot FALLBACK content, so generate-component-spec round-trip is expected-lossy here (validate passes; the anatomy drops the fallback instances). The HTML is the source of truth, not the regenerated anatomy."
      },
